<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Checkout | SabkaCode</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body><header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/">SabkaCode</a><a href="/">Back to resources</a></header><main class="container narrow"><section class="card checkout"><span class="tag">CHECKOUT</span><h1><%= product.name %></h1><p class="muted"><%= product.description %></p><div class="amount">₹<%= amount %></div><h3>1. Scan and pay the exact amount</h3><img class="qr" src="<%= qr %>" alt="UPI QR code for ₹<%= amount %>"><p class="muted small">Use any UPI app. The QR includes the fixed amount. Confirm the payee name and amount in your UPI app before paying.</p><h3>2. Submit payment details</h3>
<form action="/payments" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="form"><input type="hidden" name="productId" value="<%= product.id %>"><label>Full name<input name="customerName" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email"></label><label>Phone number <span class="muted">(optional)</span><input name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="20"></label><label>UPI transaction ID / UTR<input name="transactionId" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Enter the UPI reference number"></label><label>Payment screenshot <span class="muted">(JPG, PNG or WEBP; max 5 MB)</span><input type="file" name="screenshot" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required></label><button class="btn full" type="submit">Submit for verification</button></form><p class="small muted">Your submission remains pending until an administrator checks the UTR and payment in the receiving bank/UPI account. A screenshot alone is not proof of payment.</p></section></main></body></html>